{"term": {"label": "仁", "variants": []}, "source": {"id": "6A", "url": "https://ctext.org/mengzi/gaozi-i", "title": "告子上", "description": "告子曰：「性，猶杞柳也；義，猶桮棬也。以人性為仁義，猶以杞柳為桮棬。」\n孟子曰：「子能順杞柳之性而以為桮棬乎？將戕賊杞柳而後以為桮棬也？如將戕賊杞柳而以為桮棬，則亦將戕賊人以為仁義與？率天下之人而禍仁義者，必子之言夫！」\n告子曰：「性猶湍水也，決諸東方則東流，決諸西方則西流。人性之無分於善不善也，猶水之無分於東西也。」", "occurrences": 16, "data": null}, "network": {"directed": false, "multigraph": false, "graph": {}, "nodes": [{"form": "仁", "id": "仁"}, {"form": "信", "id": "信"}, {"form": "內", "id": "內"}, {"form": "勝", "id": "勝"}, {"form": "外", "id": "外"}, {"form": "戕", "id": "戕"}, {"form": "智", "id": "智"}, {"form": "杞", "id": "杞"}, {"form": "柳", "id": "柳"}, {"form": "桮", "id": "桮"}, {"form": "棬", "id": "棬"}, {"form": "火", "id": "火"}, {"form": "熟", "id": "熟"}, {"form": "禮", "id": "禮"}, {"form": "義", "id": "義"}, {"form": "賊", "id": "賊"}], "edges": [{"weight": 2.147878703233064, "source": "勝", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 4.45046379622711, "source": "勝", "target": "火"}, {"weight": 2.147878703233064, "source": "熟", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 3.9396381724611196, "source": "柳", "target": "杞"}, {"weight": 1.2315879713589093, "source": "柳", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 3.7164946211469094, "source": "柳", "target": "桮"}, {"weight": 3.7164946211469094, "source": "柳", "target": "棬"}, {"weight": 0.995199193294679, "source": "柳", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 3.534173064352955, "source": "柳", "target": "戕"}, {"weight": 3.534173064352955, "source": "柳", "target": "賊"}, {"weight": 1.9247351519188547, "source": "內", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 1.8601966307812834, "source": "內", "target": "外"}, {"weight": 1.6883463738546243, "source": "內", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 2.147878703233064, "source": "智", "target": "仁"}, {"weight": 2.7764873626554385, "source": "智", "target": "外"}, {"weight": 3.7573166156671647, "source": "智", "target": "禮"}, {"weight": 1.911489925168834, "source": "智", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 1.6238078527170532, "source": "外", "target": "義"}, {"weight": 1.454731522673119, "source": "外", "target"